  "rationale": "The release workflow repeatedly downloads cibuildwheel and the build package via pip on every run with no dependency cache. Pattern P-LIT-GHA-CACHE (cache dependency downloads) supports adding a pip cache keyed on the project file to reduce repeated fetching while preserving all build and publish steps. I added actions/cache@v4 for ~/.cache/pip before the pip install steps in both Python jobs (build_wheels and build_sdist), keyed on hashFiles('pyproject.toml') with a restore fallback. This changes no permissions, adds no secrets, publishing steps, or network access, and preserves the full matrix of wheel builds plus the sdist and publish jobs.",
